## Data Attributes & Accessibility

### data-slot Pattern

```typescript
// Use data-slot for styling and testing hooks
<div data-slot="item" data-error={hasError ? '' : undefined}>
  <div data-slot="control">...</div>
  <div data-slot="content">{children}</div>
</div>

// Styling with data attributes
<button
  data-size={size}
  className="h-11 data-[size=sm]:h-9"
>
```

**Uses**:
- CSS selectors: `[data-slot="item"]`
- Testing selectors
- Conditional styling: `data-[size=sm]:h-9`

### ARIA Attributes

```typescript
<button
  role="switch"
  aria-checked={value}
  aria-hidden={hidden}
  disabled={loading || disabled}
>
  <span aria-hidden="true">...</span>
</button>
```

## Children Patterns

```typescript
// ReactNode children
interface ButtonProps {
  children?: ReactNode
}

// Function children (render props)
interface RepeatProps {
  children: ReactNode | ((index: number) => ReactNode)
}

export const Repeat: FC<RepeatProps> = ({ count, children }) =>
  Array.from({ length: count }, (_, index) =>
    helper.isFunction(children) 
      ? (children as Function)(index) 
      : children
  )

// Clone element with props
const childNode = typeof children === 'function'
  ? children(props, meta, form)
  : cloneElement(children as ReactElement, props)
```

